&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_1c795b13c79aa7b0-33&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a hands-on, detail-oriented Managing Director to lead SaaS.group GmbH, our German legal entity based in Schönefeld&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will serve as the registered Managing Director on-site, exercising real decision-making authority, managing office administration, and overseeing day-to-day accounting operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4&quot;&gt;. You will serve as the local face of the company for authorities, banks, auditors, and external service providers while working in close alignment with our Central Legal, Accounting, and Finance teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_1c795b13c79aa7b0-34&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity for an experienced finance or office management professional based in the Berlin/Brandenburg region looking to step up into an official corporate leadership role within an international, fast-growing software group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Your immediate impact in the first 3-6 months will be:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_1c795b13c79aa7b0-35&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0&quot;&gt;Seamlessly transition into the registered Managing Director role for SaaS.group GmbH and establish effective on-site operational processes in Schönefeld&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2&quot;&gt;Assume complete oversight of local bookkeeping (payables, receivables, document management) and streamline month-end close workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4&quot;&gt;Build strong working relationships with our external tax advisors, auditors, banks, and internal group accounting/legal functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6&quot;&gt;Ensure full compliance with all corporate-law requirements, commercial register obligations, and internal rules of procedure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0&quot;&gt;Manage SaaS.group GmbH on-site in Schönefeld, taking full ownership of approvals, contract execution, and payment authorizations within defined rules of procedure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2&quot;&gt;Run and oversee day-to-day bookkeeping, including accounts payable/receivable, document organization, and preparation of month-end closing activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with tax advisors and auditors on VAT filings, annual financial statements, and audit processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,6&quot;&gt;Maintain strict compliance with German corporate-law obligations, including commercial register filings, transparency register updates, and shareholder resolutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,8&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,8&quot;&gt;Lead office management and operational setup in Schönefeld, managing incoming mail, vendor/service provider contracts, archiving, and filing systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,10&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,10&quot;&gt;Act as the primary local point of contact for the German tax office (Finanzamt), financial institutions, local authorities, and insurers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,12&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You bring to the table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0&quot;&gt;Vocational training in a commercial field (e.g., Tax Clerk / Steuerfachangestellte/r, Certified Accountant / Bilanzbuchhalter/in, Office Management) or equivalent practical experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2&quot;&gt;Multi-year background in accounting, financial administration, or senior office management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency with DATEV (or comparable accounting software) as well as modern digital tools (MS Office / Google Workspace)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,6&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,6&quot;&gt;Fluency in German and good working proficiency in English to collaborate effectively across our international group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,8&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,8&quot;&gt;Willingness to assume corporate liability and responsibility as a registered Managing Director (leadership experience is a plus, but not required)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,10&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,10&quot;&gt;Residence in the Berlin/Brandenburg region with the requirement for regular, physical presence at our Schönefeld office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,12&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Real Responsibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5175 citation-end-5175&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;A genuine Managing Director role with clear rules of procedure, corporate protection (D&amp;amp;O insurance included), and direct collaboration with the group CFO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5174 citation-end-5174&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Freedom and autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re a high-trust team, and you’ll be given lots of flexibility to solve problems in your own way — with plenty of help from the team when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum bureaucracy:&lt;/strong&gt; We don’t like to get bogged down with meetings and red tape. We like to be efficient and keep momentum steady &amp;amp; sustainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Small &amp;amp; friendly team:&lt;/strong&gt; We help each other out, have fun, and joke around.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our network:&lt;/strong&gt; We are a community of entrepreneurial SaaS professionals that regularly exchange ideas, knowledge, learning&amp;nbsp; and expertise with each other internally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible time off:&lt;/strong&gt; We want you to recharge your batteries when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t just simply offer you to “take a job with us” but rather to “join us on this journey” &lt;em&gt;to build the world&#39;s largest platform of independent SaaS companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds like something you’re up for? Feel free to apply even if you don’t check all these boxes. We believe in the power of diversity and fresh perspectives to spice up our team. Your application might just be the missing ingredient!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;—&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;saas.group is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive workplace. We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. If you&#39;re passionate about working with a team that values innovation, excellence, and fairness, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe in fair and transparent pay. Salary ranges at saas.group are location-adjusted, targeting local market medians for a remote-first environment, and will be shared with our potential future employees in writing before your first interview - so you have everything you need to evaluate the opportunity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/saasgroup/managing-director-focus-on-accounting-office-schonefeld-288577","tags":["Finance"],"job_types":[],"location":"Schönefeld","created_at":1792227318},{"slug":"solutions-engineer-uas-aviation-munich-114919","company_name":"Auterion","title":"Solutions Engineer UAS / Aviation","description":"&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Solutions Engineer UAS / Aviation who will play a pivotal role in the future of our company. Our Solutions Engineer will be responsible for the integration, validation, and operational readiness of Auterion-powered drone systems. You’ll collaborate closely with the production team, as well hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, and operations while ensuring that every platform transitions successfully from a physical airframe into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. This role is ideal for someone who lives and breathes drone technology and enjoys bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 and/or other autopilot&amp;nbsp; ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute End-of-Line (EoL) software validation and functional testing to ensure production readiness and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct payload and camera load-seat testing, validating integration stability and operational performance under real-world conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot embedded system issues spanning firmware, communication interfaces, sensors, and hardware-software interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to diagnose integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating closely with engineering and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to validation workflows for complete UAV systems, including components, integrated features, and operational flight configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support full-stack drone integration activities across hardware, embedded firmware, and flight software layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex integration and reliability challenges involving sensors, flight controllers, communication protocols, and power systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable impact on product quality, manufacturing throughput, and deployment readiness through improved validation and testing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to accelerate batch validation and reduce EoL cycle times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with external vendors and equipment providers to support testing infrastructure, hardware integration, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in hands-on flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. in Aviation Technology, Robotics, Embedded Systems, Electrical Engineering, or related field (M.Sc. optional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with Autopilot, Mission planning and navigation Software, including firmware flashing, configuration, and flight validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundation in embedded systems, firmware debugging, and hardware-software integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in C/C++ and/or MAVLink communication protocols or equivalent Datalink protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and flight controller configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux-based development and debugging environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UAV flight testing, system validation, and troubleshooting in real-world operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of drone manufacturing, QC processes, and End-of-Line testing methodologies is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills when working with cross-functional engineering and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently in fast-paced environments with evolving technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for drone technology and a hands-on engineering mindset focused on building reliable flying systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/auterion/solutions-engineer-uas-aviation-munich-114919","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Munich","created_at":1792227318},{"slug":"growth-associate-intern-berlin-16164","company_name":"Melotech","title":"Growth Associate (Intern)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who we are</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Melotech is revolutionizing media and entertainment. We create art through technology for humans to enjoy. In just 24 months, our work has been heard, watched and loved for over 4 billion minutes worldwide.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded by entrepreneur and investor Soheil Mirpour, we are backed by top VCs Cherry Ventures, Speedinvest and GFC, alongside world-class angels from firms such as Spotify, Blackstone and KKR.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you will do</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Melotech is scaling fast, and organic reach is one of the engines behind it. As Growth Associate (Intern), you help run that engine end to end: the creators, the formats, the trends and the numbers behind them. This is an organic growth role first, measured on how much reach every hour and every euro brings back. You work directly with our founders, our Growth Manager, product and data team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today that means a steady stream of new products that each deserve a shot at going viral across TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts. Your first job is to build the machine behind that: find the creators and communities that move culture, turn what works into repeatable playbooks, and run more experiments in a week than most teams run in a quarter.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">On a typical day, your tasks may include:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creator network:</strong> finding, briefing and paying creators and pages at scale, from small accounts with loyal audiences to the ones that set trends, and keeping the ones that deliver</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Seeding:</strong> getting our products into the formats and communities where they can travel, at the right moment and in the right volume</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Trend spotting:</strong> catching formats and memes early and moving on them within days, not weeks</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experiments:</strong> running many cheap tests every week, with clear rules for what wins and what gets killed, and turning the winners into playbooks the team can repeat</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>New channels:</strong> finding places where attention is still cheap, from fan pages and communities to platforms nobody on the team is using yet</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Organic and paid together:</strong> working with our Growth Manager so organic winners get scaled with paid, and what paid learns feeds back into organic</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Measurement:</strong> knowing which number answers which question, for example what saves and shares tell you that views do not, and what each view really costs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tooling:</strong> building the trackers, scripts and automations you need, with platform data and AI tools as your daily coworkers</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who you are</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for a student or recent graduate who lives on the platforms and wants to learn how to make content travel.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Typically, your profile will look like this:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Platform fluency:</strong> you know TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts well and can explain why a post performs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hands-on experience:</strong> you have grown an account, a page or a side project, or supported a startup or brand on social</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creator marketing:</strong> you enjoy working with creators and have a feel for content that looks native</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creativity:</strong> you bring fresh ideas and test them in a structured way</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Analytical:</strong> you are comfortable with numbers and spreadsheets; SQL, Python or AI tools are a plus</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pace:</strong> you thrive in a fast-paced and performance-oriented environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A big plus:</strong> you are a creator yourself, or have run pages with a real following</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Academics:</strong> pursuing or recently graduated with a degree at a top-tier university, with an outstanding academic record: grades, scholarships or awards to show for it</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What makes this exciting</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You own a lever the whole company feels. Every breakout you engineer shows up directly in how fast we can grow, at a fraction of what paid reach would cost. You're not a cog in the machine but the captain of your own ship, rewarded for performance and respected for leadership. Flat hierarchies mean that your voice matters, your ideas get implemented, and your impact is immediate.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We pay competitive salaries and make you an owner of the business with equity. We work remotely to give you complete freedom over your life, while meeting regularly around the world for global offsites where we strategize, bond, and push boundaries together.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What the process will look like</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We hire on a rolling basis. Earliest starting date is always ASAP.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Once you begin our process, you can progress from start to offer within a week, depending on how quickly you can move through each stage:</p><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Initial interview: 30-minute introductory call, getting to know you</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Case interview: 90-minute case discussion, present and debate your skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founder interview: 90-minute interview with our CEO, going deep on all topics</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Offer, contract signing and onboarding</p></li></ol><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Note: As we are still in stealth, you will learn more about Melotech as you progress through the stages. By the end of the Founder interview, you will have a full grasp of our business and the details of your role.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/melotech/growth-associate-intern-berlin-16164","tags":["Marketing & Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1792226419},{"slug":"organic-growth-lead-berlin-122857","company_name":"Melotech","title":"Organic Growth Lead","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who we are</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Melotech is revolutionizing media and entertainment. We create art through technology for humans to enjoy. In just 24 months, our work has been heard, watched and loved for over 4 billion minutes worldwide.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded by entrepreneur and investor Soheil Mirpour, we are backed by top VCs Cherry Ventures, Speedinvest and GFC, alongside world-class angels from firms such as Spotify, Blackstone and KKR.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you will do</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Melotech is scaling fast, and organic reach is one of the engines behind it. As Organic Growth Lead, you own that engine end to end: the creators, the formats, the trends and the numbers behind them. This is an organic growth role first, measured on how much reach every hour and every euro brings back. You work directly with our founders, our Growth Manager, product and data team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today that means a steady stream of new products that each deserve a shot at going viral across TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts. Your first job is to build the machine behind that: find the creators and communities that move culture, turn what works into repeatable playbooks, and run more experiments in a week than most teams run in a quarter.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">On a typical day, your tasks may include:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creator network:</strong> finding, briefing and paying creators and pages at scale, from small accounts with loyal audiences to the ones that set trends, and keeping the ones that deliver</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Seeding:</strong> getting our products into the formats and communities where they can travel, at the right moment and in the right volume</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Trend spotting:</strong> catching formats and memes early and moving on them within days, not weeks</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experiments:</strong> running many cheap tests every week, with clear rules for what wins and what gets killed, and turning the winners into playbooks the team can repeat</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>New channels:</strong> finding places where attention is still cheap, from fan pages and communities to platforms nobody on the team is using yet</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Organic and paid together:</strong> working with our Growth Manager so organic winners get scaled with paid, and what paid learns feeds back into organic</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Measurement:</strong> knowing which number answers which question, for example what saves and shares tell you that views do not, and what each view really costs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tooling:</strong> building the trackers, scripts and automations you need, with platform data and AI tools as your daily coworkers</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who you are</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for a hands-on organic operator who lives on the platforms, or a creative growth generalist who has made things travel. Either way, you have done it yourself, not through a team or an agency, and you can show the numbers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Typically, your profile will look like this:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Interest:</strong> a strong interest in organic growth, creator marketing and social, ideally with hands-on experience from a startup, brand, app, creator agency or your own channels</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Breakouts you can show:</strong> you have made things go viral more than once, for a brand, an app or your own channels, and you can explain why it worked and what it cost</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creator marketing at scale:</strong> you have run creator or UGC programs with many creators at once, negotiated the rates and written briefs that keep the content native; ideally you bring a network of creators, pages and managers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Platform fluency:</strong> you know how TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts distribute content today, what makes a hook, and when a format is burning out</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creativity with discipline:</strong> you come up with ideas nobody else would try, and then test them properly, with small budgets, kill rules and numbers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Measurement:</strong> you track reach, engagement and cost per view in your own data, not in screenshots, and you judge every channel by what it brings back</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data and tooling:</strong> you are fast in spreadsheets, ideally comfortable with SQL or Python, and you automate the boring parts with AI tools</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pace:</strong> you thrive in a fast-paced and performance-oriented environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A big plus:</strong> you are or were a creator yourself, or have run pages with a real following, and you're into media, entertainment, gaming or social</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What makes this exciting</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You own a lever the whole company feels. Every breakout you engineer shows up directly in how fast we can grow, at a fraction of what paid reach would cost. You're not 