ation":"Berlin","created_at":1792226419},{"slug":"founding-head-of-brand-berlin-385658","company_name":"Melotech","title":"Founding Head of Brand","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who we are</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Melotech is revolutionizing media and entertainment. We create art through technology for humans to enjoy. In just 24 months, our work has been heard, watched and loved for over 4 billion minutes worldwide.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded by entrepreneur and investor Soheil Mirpour, we are backed by top VCs Cherry Ventures, Speedinvest and GFC, alongside world-class angels from firms such as Spotify, Blackstone and KKR.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you will do</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Melotech's products already reach millions, yet hardly anyone knows the brand. That is where you come in.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are our founding brand hire, and you will define what Melotech means to the world from a blank page. There is no brand book, no house style, no established narrative to protect. You decide how we sound, who we are for and why anyone should care, then you make the world take notice. On a typical day, your tasks may include:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Defining our story: one coherent narrative that makes sense of what we are building for fans, press and partners, and keeping it consistent everywhere it shows up</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Owning how the world perceives us across earned media, owned channels, partnerships and the moments we create ourselves</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working with our creatives to ship creative campaigns and stunts that earn attention rather than buy it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Opening doors with your own network of press, creators and brands, and turning those relationships into partnerships that would not happen without you</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5