g, and coaching teams on agent-first workflows, proof-of-value motions, and customer co-building.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in German and English.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1>Nice to Haves:</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience launching or scaling a country-first or regional GTM operating model.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with enterprise security, compliance, APIs, webhooks, connectors, data residency, AI governance, and technical evaluation processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience scaling partner, channel, marketplace, or consultant-led GTM motions around AI or workflow transformation.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re an equal opportunity employer and encourage candidates to apply even if not matching every bullet.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notion is committed to providing highly competitive cash compensation, equity, and benefits. The compensation offered for this role will be based on multiple factors such as location, the role's scope and complexity, and the candidate's experience and expertise, and may vary from the range provided below. The estimated on target earnings (including base salary and on target incentive pay) for this role is €350,000 - 420,000 per year.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">By clicking “Submit Application”, I understand and agree that Notion and its affiliates and subsidiaries will collect and process my information in accordance with Notion’s <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://notion.notion.site/Notion-Global-Recruiting-Privacy-Policy-fc3eb4e829354a26a2bb6fd5e289b550"><u>Global Recruiting Privacy Policy</u></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://dev.notion.so/a3ce416456924276a59de91bca740028?pvs=21"><u>.</u></a></p><div style="min-heig