ur Team</strong> Be part of a collaborative, innovative environment where your technical skills and product instincts can make a real impact. We offer competitive compensation, professional development opportunities, and a supportive work culture. Apply now and take the next step in your career.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At The Global Talent Co., our mission is to bridge the gap between leading global tech companies and amazing global talent. We believe everyone deserves equal access to opportunities, regardless of the country they happen to be born in.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/the-global-talent-co/junior-recruiter-german-speaking-berlin-394770","tags":["Admin & Support Functions"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1792194022},{"slug":"forward-deployed-engineer-berlin-447106","company_name":"Langdock","title":"Forward Deployed Engineer - m/f/d","description":"<h1>Help Us Change the Way the World Works</h1><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Turn AI ambition into production systems that run the business</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Langdock exists to change the way the world works, bridging the gap between what technology can do and what people actually do with it. We bring all leading AI models into one secure, model-agnostic platform and make them usable across entire organizations. Over 10,000 companies use our platform every day, from fast-growing startups to some of Europe's largest enterprises.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>About the Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Most enterprises have bought AI. Far fewer have it running their core operations. As a Forward Deployed Engineer at Langdock, you take our most valuable customer use cases from idea to production. You work inside the customer's problem, build the agents, workflows, apps and integrations that solve it, and turn every win into a reusable pattern the whole company can use.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You work as part of Customer Success alongside our Account Owner, and you are the technical partner in the customer's transformation. You will feed what you learn in the field back into our product, and you will have real influence over what we build next.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">And you will build with our own platform every day. Everyone at Langdock automates their own work with agents and workflows. You will too.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>What You Will Do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run technical discovery on qualified, high-value use cases: map processes, systems, data flows and constraints with both business and technical stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and build production-grade agents, workflows, Skills, Apps and integrations on Langdock, from first prototype to company-wide rollout.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the implementation of advanced and beta-feature use cases, and of high-profile proofs of concept, together with the Account Owner.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn individual solutions you built into reusable patterns, templates and on-platform resources, and maintain the bundles repository.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Measure impact: time saved, costs reduced, tools replaced, quality improved and time to value. Package the results into ROI stories that customers and colleagues can act on.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support our Partners with architecture reviews, high-profile scoping sessions and targeted enablement, so they can deliver independently.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be the technical voice of the customer internally, without losing sight of our principle: Product &gt; Customer Success &gt; Marketing &gt; Sales.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>You Might Be a Fit If…</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have 3+ years of experience building production software, data or integration systems, ideally in a customer-facing role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You build with AI, not just talk about it. You have hands-on experience with LLM APIs, agents, tool use, retrieval and workflow automation, and you know how to choose between models and approaches.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can talk credibly about data privacy, security, identity and integration architecture with CISOs, IT leads and engineers, because you have solved these problems before.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are good at scoping. You know which work is worth doing, you say no to the rest, and you ship what you commit to.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You translate business problems into technical designs and technical trade-offs into business terms for executives.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are commercially aware. You understand that your work drives retention and expansion, and you care about that outcome.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are fluent in German (C1+) and English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are a kind person who cares about the people around you.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bonus:</strong> you come from an AI-native company or an early-stage startup. Founder or early-employee experience is a plus, as are public projects such as MCP servers, open-source contributions or AI tooling you have shipped.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>The Environment</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We work from our office in Berlin, Greifswalder Strasse 212. Everyone works together in person because the hardest problems get solved faster at a whiteboard than in a Slack thread. Days start at 8:30. Lunch and dinner are together. We run, go to the gym, and take care of ourselves. Health is not separate from work here, it is part of how we work well.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The vibe is calm but intense. No one is yelling or panicking. But everyone is working hard on things that matter.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Compensation</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Salaries are transparent and tied to levels, not negotiation. All roles include equity. We will figure out the right level together based on your experience and scope. Levels are about the work you own, not your title or years of experience. We narrow down the expected salary range early in the process.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Next steps</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We move fast. Most processes complete within two weeks.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If this sounds like your kind of work, we would like to meet you.</p><div><div style="left:0;width:100%;height:0;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe src="https://embedded-media.ashbyhq.com/embed/4c391c82-4c37-466e-8edf-f3b3b78a1aa2/d48aa50e-3456-44b9-8702-0cc64848c984" style="top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;border:0" allowfullscreen scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media *; picture-in-picture *;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-presentation"></iframe></div></div><hr><p>Compensation: €90K – €140K • Offers Equity</p><ul><li> • Base Salary €90K – €140K • Offers Equity</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/langdock/forward-deployed-engineer-berlin-447106","tags":["Business"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1792194021},{"slug":"machine-learning-engineer-applied-ai-germany-371827","company_name":"Bjak","title":"Machine Learning Engineer, Applied AI","description":"<h2><strong>About</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">There are over 5 billion users using basic applications today such email, notes, tasks, calendar and they're not AI-native. Our mission is to build proactive applications for anyone in the world, who are not used to complex prompting. We aim to bring intelligence to conversations, errands, organising and workflows, with minimal to no prompting.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our first application is an agent-first mobile communication app. We believe building applications that users use daily for communication, coordination and collaboration needs will help integrate AI into their lives. The net effect is to eliminate misinformation, achieve low coordination costs, enable high quality tasks and collaboration at scale with minimal or little prompting.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and improve ML systems that power our AI-native applications.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work on classification, retrieval, ranking, personalization and evaluation, taking ownership from model development to production deployment.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is for engineers who enjoy solving practical ML problems, improving model quality and shipping reliable systems used by real users.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Focus</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and improve ML models for classification, ranking, retrieval and personalization.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop efficient classifiers and optimize model accuracy, precision, latency and cost.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Improve search relevance and context retrieval using embeddings, hybrid search and reranking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build personalization models that learn from user behavior while respecting privacy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop evaluation pipelines, labeled datasets and metrics to measure model quality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fine-tune and adapt existing models when supported by sufficient data.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and maintain ML training, inference and deployment pipelines.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Debug production issues, monitor model performance and ship improvements based on real-world feedback.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Tech Stack</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Python</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">PyTorch / JAX</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Embeddings, vector search and ranking models</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Production ML systems and inference pipelines</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Ideal Experience</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong foundations in machine learning and modern neural architectures.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience building and deploying ML models in production.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in classification, ranking, retrieval, recommendation systems or personalization.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understanding of model evaluation, experimentation and performance metrics.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable writing production-quality code and working with real-world datasets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to balance model quality, latency, cost and reliability.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong ownership, problem-solving skills</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Outcomes</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ML models in production meet expected accuracy, relevance, latency and reliability targets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Classification and ranking improvements deliver measurable gains in model quality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Evaluation pipelines identify regressions and support reliable model releases.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Training, inference and data pipelines are robust, reproducible and maintainable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Model improvements are driven by real-world feedback and measurable results.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborates effectively with engineering and product teams to deliver reliable ML-powered features.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>How We Work</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">The best products in the world are built by small, world-class teams. We are a high-talent-density, hands-on team. We make decisions collectively and move quickly, balancing high-quality work with continuous learning.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Joining our team requires the ability to bring structure, exercise judgment and execute independently. Our goal is to put a truly magical product into the hands of our users.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Interview Process</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">If there appears to be a fit, we'll reach out to schedule 3, but no more than 4 interviews.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Applications are evaluated by our technical team members. Interviews will be conducted virtually and/or onsite.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We value transparency and efficiency, so expect a prompt decision. If you've demonstrated the exceptional skills and mindset we're looking for, we'll extend an offer to join us.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/bjak/machine-learning-engineer-applied-ai-germany-371827","tags":["ActAI Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Germany","created_at":1792194021},{"slug":"staff-software-engineer-hosting-services-london-13503","company_name":"airbnb","title":"Staff Software Engineer - Hosting Services","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if you could help shape the next generation of services that make hosting on Airbnb easier, smarter and more rewarding?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Airbnb, we&#39;re expanding beyond our core platform to create new products, partnerships and services that unlock opportunities for Hosts and introduce entirely new business lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Hosting Services engineering team is entering an exciting phase of growth, with ambitious plans to accelerate the development of new products and third-party integrations. We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who can help us turn that ambition into reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to shape technical direction, build products from the ground up and rethink how we scale engineering innovation. You&#39;ll join an ambitious London-based engineering team, collaborating closely with colleagues in the US, with the autonomy to challenge ideas, influence strategy and create meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited by solving complex problems, building products people genuinely want to use and turning bold ideas into scalable businesses, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Software Engineer in Hosting Services, you&#39;ll play a pivotal role in defining and delivering the technical foundations for Airbnb&#39;s expanding ecosystem of Host services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is more than an architectural leadership role. You&#39;ll be a hands-on technical leader, product thinker and strategic partner, helping take new ideas from concept to launch, then continuously improving them to deliver meaningful customer and business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across engineering, product, design and business teams to shape what we build, how we build it and how we scale our ability to innovate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced, product-oriented engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who combines deep technical expertise with the curiosity, ambition and leadership to build what&#39;s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your impact will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build new products from zero to one:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the technical design and development of new customer-facing products, services and third-party integrations, helping create new business opportunities for Airbnb.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape technical strategy and architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Define the future state of major systems and services, designing flexible, reliable and scalable solutions that balance immediate product needs with long-term technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate engineering innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify new approaches, reusable patterns, tooling and AI-enabled development opportunities that allow engineering teams to deliver more products and integrations without proportionally increasing complexity or resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the full product lifecycle:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product and design teams from early discovery and ideation through development, launch, iteration and product-market fit, ensuring solutions deliver measurable value to Hosts and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead across the technology stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply your expertise across backend systems, APIs, frontend, mobile and distributed architecture, remaining hands-on where needed to solve complex engineering challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide engineers across teams in making sound architectural decisions, navigating technical trade-offs and maintaining high standards of reliability, performance, efficiency and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence beyond your immediate team:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineering, product, UX, data science, data engineering and business stakeholders to align technical decisions with broader product and commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenge what&#39;s possible:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring fresh thinking, question existing approaches and proactively identify opportunities to build better products, move faster and expand the impact of our engineering organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Experience &amp;amp; Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally within fast-paced, product-led technology environments, with a track record of delivering complex, high-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong backend engineering expertise&lt;/strong&gt;, including designing and developing large-scale, service-oriented and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience building customer-facing products from zero to one&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to product definition, technical architecture, development and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end product ownership&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience iterating on launched products, responding to customer feedback and improving adoption, usability and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Broad full-stack engineering capability&lt;/strong&gt;, with the confidence to work across backend, frontend, mobile, APIs and system architecture as technical challenges require.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong architectural design skills&lt;/strong&gt;, including high-scale distributed services, well-designed APIs, data pipelines, efficient algorithms and reliable integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound technical judgment&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to balance speed of delivery, experimentation, scalability and long-term engineering quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A product-first engineering mindset&lt;/strong&gt;, with an understanding that technical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£120,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£150,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/airbnb/staff-software-engineer-hosting-services-london-13503","tags":["Software Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792270515},{"slug":"senior-data-architect-wealth-asset-management-380839","company_name":"capco","title":"Senior Data Architect - Wealth & Asset Management.","description":"&lt;h1&gt;Senior Data Architect – Wealth &amp;amp; Asset Management&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Data &amp;amp; Analytics | Type: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design the blueprint. Architect the future of Wealth &amp;amp; Asset Management. Empower data transformation through modern, AI-enabled ways of working.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is seeking a Senior Data Architect to lead and deliver complex data architecture initiatives across our Wealth &amp;amp; Asset Management clients. In this senior consulting role, you will guide wealth managers, asset managers, and private banks through large-scale data transformation journeys – defining enterprise data strategies, designing target architectures, and building scalable, cloud-based platforms that support advisor and client experiences, investment analytics, regulatory reporting, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside client delivery, you will contribute to evolving Capco’s Wealth &amp;amp; Asset Management data architecture propositions and thought leadership in modern, cloud-native data ecosystems, exploring how approved AI tools, including Generative AI and Agentic AI where appropriate, can improve insight, productivity, and delivery while maintaining human oversight and responsible AI guardrails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead agile consulting engagements delivering modern data architecture and cloud transformation across Wealth &amp;amp; Asset Management, using approved AI-enabled workflows and automation where appropriate to improve delivery speed, quality, and insight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and implement scalable enterprise data strategies spanning programmes and business units, including canonical WAM data domains and models across client/household, portfolio/account, holdings/transactions, instruments and pricing, performance, and fees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Architect and deliver cloud-native data platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP) that enable advisor/client journeys and advanced investment analytics, including risk, performance and reporting, while defining integration patterns across core WAM platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish robust data quality, reconciliation and control frameworks, alongside master and reference data strategies aligned to governance, metadata, privacy and stewardship, with appropriate audit trails, review and escalation pathways for AI-enabled processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a subject matter expert, translating complex technical concepts into clear business value for senior stakeholders and applying human judgement when evaluating AI-generated insights, recommendations, or outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience delivering enterprise data architecture and cloud data engineering, including platform design within Wealth &amp;amp; Asset Management environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep knowledge of contextual, logical and physical data modelling practices across Front Office, Investments, Operations and Risk/Compliance, with a strong understanding of core WAM data concepts including client/householding, suitability and risk profiling, holdings/positions, trade lifecycle, pricing, performance and fees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud-based data ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP), modern data stacks, cloud migration and transformation programmes, and integration across CRM, OMS/PMS, wealth back office, custody/fund accounting, market data and reporting platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of data management tooling, security frameworks and control environments within regulated financial services, including WAM regulatory and ESG requirements such as MiFID II, SFDR, PRIIPs/KIDs and FATCA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to engage stakeholders across technical and non-technical teams, alongside curiosity about practical applications of approved AI tools, automation and AI-enabled workflows, with an understanding of responsible AI, human-in-the-loop review and appropriate controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
