-height:1.5em">Win new trade businesses by finding high-potential small and medium trades, building proposals that make sense for them and negotiating terms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hand each new trade over smoothly to our vetting team, so the start of their Checkatrade journey goes well.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Spot opportunities in the market, using data and insights to see where Checkatrade is strong and where we can grow.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with Account Management, Vetting, Product and Operations to find the regions and categories that would benefit most from Checkatrade.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Learn our product suite inside out, so every business case is tailored to the prospect in front of you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the outbound sales cycle, from prospecting and qualification through to proposals, negotiation and closing.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The fit:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid experience in commercial or new business sales, ideally in similar markets, with a strong focus on outbound acquisition.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of finding new clients, building tailored proposals and hitting revenue targets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The knack for building strong relationships with tradespeople, and working closely with colleagues across teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence juggling multiple priorities and improving how things get done.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building customer relationships, whether through digital outreach or face-to-face conversations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tenacity and resilience. This is a test-and-learn environment where persistence matters.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nice to have: familiarity with CRM systems (Salesforce) and outbound tools, and an 