s and customer value exchange, ensuring technical strategy connects them where it matters</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Champion engineering best practices across teams, promoting quality and a culture of technical innovation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive operational excellence, ensuring teams have robust monitoring, alerting and incident management processes in place</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We'd love to hear from you if you have... 🔍</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience leading engineering teams and delivering complex, multi-team initiatives</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong track record of developing people, building high-performing teams and growing future leaders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to inspire trust and autonomy at all levels, fostering a positive, inclusive and high-performing team culture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort operating across multiple, distinct product domains and connecting them into a coherent technical strategy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enjoyment working in a dynamic, collaborative and highly cross-functional environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to influence at all levels of the organisation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence leading through ambiguity, creating clarity and momentum in complex or uncertain situations</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>More information:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enjoy fantastic perks like private healthcare &amp; dental insurance, a generous work from abroad policy, 2-for-1 share purchase plans, an EV Scheme to further reduce carbon emissions, extra festive time off, and excellent family-friendly benefits. </p><p style="min-hei