rt of the <strong>Business Strategy &amp; Operations (BSO)</strong> team, whose goal is to</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define an <strong>ambitious strategy</strong> to achieve our business objectives and translate this into an <strong>actionable plan</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Monitor and explain our performance</strong> towards our business objectives</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Enable our Sales and Account Management teams</strong> to achieve these business objectives and become the most effective commercial teams in the tech industry (i.e., Sales and AM effectiveness, tools, analytics and training)</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Across all these areas we work very closely with the Senior Leadership, the Sales, Account Management and Go-to-Market teams. The <strong>scope is Global</strong> (France, Belgium, Spain and Canada for the time being).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>🎯 Your mission</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be owning medium to large scale/complexity projects (depending on your skills and experience) <strong>on the Business Planning and Strategy area. These would include:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Business Strategy</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work closely with senior business leaders</strong> (Business leads, Insurance Lead, Marketing lead, CFO, CEO, etc.) <strong>to define Alan’s business plan</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Frame business and resource allocation decisions</strong> (e.g. where to accelerate/slow down in terms of segments or products, where to deploy sales and marketing resources, how to optimize for short vs. long term, what are is the impact on metrics such as payback, LTV, CAC)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Propose adjustments to the plan</strong> on a quarterly basis and 