 leaders</strong> (Business leads, Insurance Lead, Marketing lead, CFO, CEO, etc.) <strong>to define Alan’s business plan</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Frame business and resource allocation decisions</strong> (e.g. where to accelerate/slow down in terms of segments or products, where to deploy sales and marketing resources, how to optimize for short vs. long term, what are is the impact on metrics such as payback, LTV, CAC)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Propose adjustments to the plan</strong> on a quarterly basis and support Board preparation</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sales &amp; Account Manager Planning</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Translate the plan into actionable sales &amp; Account Management objectives</strong>, ensuring their quality, scalability and accuracy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build &amp; improve the infrastructure to </strong>track these targets (dashboard, models) hand in hand with the data team</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Performance monitoring &amp; Steering</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead or support strategic explorations</strong> (e.g. new segment, new distribution models) to frame strategic decisions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Monitor closely results and execution</strong> to gather learnings and adjust where necessary, sharing key learnings with the community and the company on a monthly basis</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work on transversal topics </strong>that allow us to gain insights &amp; better steer the team performance (competition analysis, implementation &amp; monitoring of pricing strategies, ...)</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul></li></ul><h1>🧐 Skills we are looking for</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We look above all for exceptional people motiva