ay</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to build successful relationships with a broad range of stakeholders across Sales, Marketing, Product and Finance and be seen as a trusted contributor/advisor</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work well under pressure, with a high degree of adaptability and flexibility</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Great written and oral structure and communication</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in English (French is a strong plus)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Being based in (or willing to relocate to) the <strong>Paris or Barcelona area</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with BI and visualization tools (Metabase, Tableau) and Salesforce</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in the SaaS/Tech sectors</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to large sales teams (100+)</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">For this opportunity, we are aiming to hire within the C1-D<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers/a/salary-equity"> <u>level range</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>🙌 </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/about/life-at-alan/a/perks"><strong>Perks &amp; Benefits</strong></a></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Alan, we believe that <strong>being in good health is a basic need</strong>, and it starts with our employees. This is why Alaners are provided with a stimulating environment and perks ensuring they are <strong>happy, efficient and spend only high-quality time</strong> with co-workers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Therefore, we offer:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fair rewards</strong>. Generous equity packages complement you