ractices, and create alignment around a long-term value plan.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Main missions include:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Market intelligence:</strong> You’ll build expertise on our market and competitive landscape. You’ll work both on the quantitative side (sizing) and the qualitative side (customers’ pain points and needs).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Value proposition and pricing</strong>: Our goal is to differentiate our offer from the market. You’ll relentlessly ask yourself: what is the best product offering to become leader in this segment?</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Go-to-Market strategy: </strong>You’ll work both on renewal (account management) and expansion strategy (business development). This will require you to adapt and innovate when it comes to distribution<strong> </strong>channels, sub-segments, and partners management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>P&amp;L ownership &amp; Resources allocation: </strong>You’ll own the return on investment of your segment and are in charge of building the case for internal resources allocation based on your P&amp;L.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product trade-off: </strong>You’ll work together with product teams in order for us to build the best product based on market insights.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>We are currently hiring for new segments:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">It gathers several, high potential sub-segments where everything is to be built.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We will focus heavily on those new opportunities in the coming years.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>⭐️ If you have some of the following, you may be a great fit ⭐️</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least <strong>8 years of prior experience leading a business</strong> (product category, business segment, etc.)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Full working proficiency in <strong>French</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least advanced level in <strong>English</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An exceptional <strong>ability to establish transversal influence</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Used to analyze and manipulate data to build a 360 degree view of your market</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong <strong>business sense</strong> while being able to go deep into <strong>product considerations</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Able to articulate </strong>clear strategies in spite of complexity/uncertainty</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A prior experience working with senior leadership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are a generalist self-starter </strong>(Vs a specialist of 1 single  industry) able to adapt fast and not afraid to go on the field to support your team mates and learn from them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are based in (or willing to relocate to) either<strong> Paris, Bordeaux, Lyon, Marseille, Brussels, Madrid or Barcelona</strong>.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For this role, we are looking to hire within the E-F <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers/a/salary-equity">level range</a>. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>🙌 </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/about/life-at-alan/a/perks"><strong>Perks &amp; Benefits</strong></a></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Alan, we believe that <strong>being in good health is a basic need</strong>, and it starts with our employees. This is why Alaners are provided with a stimulating environment and perks ensuring they are <strong>happy, efficie