<li><strong>Fully remote working arrangement:</strong> Work remotely from an eligible location within Europe.</li>
<li><strong>International working environment:</strong> Collaborate with finance professionals and stakeholders across an international software group.</li>
<li><strong>Entrepreneurial team culture:</strong> Benefit from a hands-on environment that encourages ownership, initiative, and practical problem-solving.</li>
<li><strong>Professional development:</strong> Expand your accounting expertise and gain exposure to international financial operations, reporting, and process improvement.</li>
