 - that's still a manual, months-long process. We're building the infrastructure that gives AI agents access to the physical world.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are one of the fastest growing biotech companies, trusted by leading biopharmas, frontier AI labs, and the techbio companies pushing the field forward. This is a rare chance to help advance some of the most important work happening in biotech today.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our automated lab is powered by a deep software + hardware stack: lab instruments worth millions of USD reverse-engineered into API-controllable hardware, dozens of devices orchestrated through complex workflows, full observability on everything that happens in the lab, processing pipelines for messy physical-world data, and AI systems that troubleshoot production results and accelerate assay development.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re growing rapidly and are hiring for talented people to scale and support the massive demand for AI-driven wet lab experimentation.</p><h2>About the Role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on research role in our biology and production team. You'll work on the science that underpins everything Adaptyv does: developing and optimizing protein expression systems, running molecular biology workflows, and pushing the boundaries of what we can produce and characterize at scale.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We express proteins at high volume across cell-free and cell-based systems, run DNA synthesis and assembly at high throughput, and characterize binding, stability, and function using BLI, SPR, and enzymatic assays.</p><h2>What you'll do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop and optimize protein expression workflows - cell-free expression (PURE, lysate-based), E. coli, and potentially mammalian systems. Troubleshoot when proteins don't express, misfold, or aggregate.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and execute DNA synthesis and assembly protocols: PCR, Golden Gate, Gibson. Improve yield, fidelity, and throughput.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop new assays or adapt existing ones for the platform - thermostability, developability, enzyme activity, or whatever the next customer need demands.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run experiments yourself. This is not a project management role. You'll be at the bench doing molecular biology, analyzing data, and iterating on protocols.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the automation team to translate your methods into automated workflows. You develop the protocol that works; they make the robots run it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Analyze experimental data, identify failure modes, and improve methods systematically. When 20% of constructs in a batch fail to express, you figure out why.</p></li></ul><h2>What we're looking for</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>MSc or PhD in molecular biology, biochemistry, bioengineering, or a related field.</strong> Hands-on depth matters most - years at the bench doing real molecular biology counts more than the degree title.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Practical protein expression and purification skills.</strong> You've expressed recombinant proteins and know what it takes to get them soluble, folded, and functional.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experience with DNA synthesis, cloning, or assembly methods</strong> (PCR, Golden Gate, Gibson). High-throughput experience is a plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Comfortable with data analysis</strong> - you interpret chromatograms, binding curves, and expression gels without hand-holding.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Rigorous experimentalist.</strong> You keep detailed notes, design proper controls, and understand why reproducibility matters when you're running hundreds of experiments a month.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Interested in automation.</strong> You don't need to program robots, but you should want your protocols to become automated workflows rather than staying manual forever.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Independent and resourceful.</strong> You troubleshoot using literature, first principles, and experimentation - not by waiting for someone to tell you what to try next.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location:</strong> Lausanne, Switzerland (on-site - this is a lab role).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Application deadline</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are reviewing applicants on a rolling basis.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/adaptyv/bioengineer-molecular-biologist-lausanne-48490","tags":["Biology"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Lausanne","created_at":1792064438},{"slug":"scientist-protein-expression-purification-lausanne-14943","company_name":"Adaptyv","title":"Scientist, Protein Expression & Purification","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Adaptyv is building an automated lab that lets AI agents run biology experiments. </strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're entering the era of agentic science where AI models can now design novel proteins, propose hypotheses, and iterate on experimental results. But they can't run the experiments themselves - that's still a manual, months-long process. We're building the infrastructure that gives AI agents access to the physical world.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are one of the fastest growing biotech companies, trusted by leading biopharmas, frontier AI labs, and the techbio companies pushing the field forward. This is a rare chance to help advance some of the most important work happening in biotech today.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our automated lab is powered by a deep software + hardware stack: lab instruments worth millions of USD reverse-engineered into API-controllable hardware, dozens of devices orchestrated through complex workflows, full observability on everything that happens in the lab, processing pipelines for messy physical-world data, and AI systems that troubleshoot production results and accelerate assay development.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re growing rapidly and are hiring for talented people to scale and support the massive demand for AI-driven wet lab experimentation.</p><h2>About the Role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll build out protein expression and purification at Adaptyv, with a focus on mammalian systems — CHO and HEK, transient and stable. This is the foundation the rest of the platform stands on: titers, quality, and turnaround here set the ceiling for everything downstream.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your job is to take expression and purification from bespoke, person-dependent protocols to a robust, automated, high-throughput product. You'll optimize and run the science hands-on, work with lab automation to scale it onto liquid handlers and automated systems, and work with the software team to track samples, capture process data, and make production observable and predictable. You'll lead the science and stay deeply hands-on.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop, optimize, and run mammalian expression hands-on (CHO/HEK, transient and stable), pushing titer, quality, and reproducibility.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own purification across modalities (Protein A, IEX, SEC, and related) and the quality of the proteins we ship.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn expression and purification into a productized, high-throughput, automated capability with predictable turnaround.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with lab automation to scale workflows onto automated systems, and reduce manual, person-dependent steps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the software team to track samples and process parameters, and make production yields and quality observable and improvable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set the quality bar and troubleshoot the inevitable failures across biology, reagents, and process.</p></li></ul><h2>What We're Looking For</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deep, hands-on expertise in mammalian protein expression and purification</strong> — CHO/HEK, and the full path from construct to purified, characterized protein.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Applied industry experience.</strong> You've run expression and purification in a production or industrial setting — where yield, reproducibility, and turnaround mattered at scale — not primarily in an academic research project. This is the core requirement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Track record of making production reliable</strong> — titer optimization, scale-up, and consistent quality, not one-off preps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Builder who moves fast.</strong> You want to stand up and continuously improve a production capability, not run a fixed protocol.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Interdisciplinary.</strong> You collaborate naturally with automation engineers and software people, and you see automation and data as core to a modern production process.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Data fluency (scripting, tracking and analyzing process data) is a strong plus.</p></li></ul><h2>Details</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location:</strong> Lausanne, Switzerland (on-site)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Type:</strong> Full time</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Start date:</strong> ASAP</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Application deadline</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are reviewing applicants on a rolling basis.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/adaptyv/scientist-protein-expression-purification-lausanne-14943","tags":["Biology"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Lausanne","created_at":1792064438},{"slug":"qualifizierungsingenieur-gmp-compliance-projektstandort-visp-335786","company_name":"Bakerhicks","title":"Qualifizierungsingenieur (w/m/d) - GMP Compliance / Projektstandort Visp","description":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Für unseren Projektstandort in &lt;strong&gt;Visp&lt;/strong&gt; suchen wir einen Qualifizierungsingenieur (w/m/d) mit Eintrittstermin nach Absprache.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bereitest Risikoanalysen sowie Qualifizierungen (DQ, IQ, OQ, PQ) projektgerecht vor, führst sie durch, dokumentierst und wertest sie aus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du identifizierst Ursachen, bewertest fachlich und setzt Change- sowie Abweichungsmanagement (inkl. CAPA) um – inklusive deren Nachverfolgung und Überwachung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In der Erstellung von SOPs sowie in der Planung und Durchführung GMP-konformer Schulungen bringst Du Dein Know-how ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt aktiv bei der Vorbereitung, Durchführung und Nachbereitung externer Inspektionen (Audits) im Bereich Qualifizierung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Qualifizierung von Process Automation Systems (PAS) gehört ebenfalls zu Deinem Verantwortungsbereich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;liquidDesignProfilePublication&quot; class=&quot;liquid-design-box&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein Studium in Biotechnologie, Chemieingenieurwesen, Pharma-/Medizintechnik oder eine vergleichbare Ausbildung sowie mindestens 5 Jahre Erfahrung im Bereich CQV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualifizierungsprozesse, Projektmanagement und Projektverantwortung sind Dir vertraut.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest qualitätsorientiert, selbstständig und bringst ein hohes Maß an Eigeninitiative mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mit Deinen sehr guten analytischen Fähigkeiten und Deiner strukturierten Arbeitsweise überzeugst Du im Projektalltag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist kommunikationsstark in Deutsch und Englisch, moderierst sicher und bist projektbezogen im In- und Ausland reisebereit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über BakerHicks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;17&quot; data-end=&quot;251&quot;&gt;Seit 1957 sind wir Vorreiter in den Bereichen Design, Engineering und Projektmanagement. Von der Beratung bis hin zum Bau und der Compliance unterstützen unsere multidisziplinären Design- und Ingenieurteams Unternehmen auf der ganzen Welt dabei, ihre Projekte auf die effizienteste, kostengünstigste und nachhaltigste Weise zu realisieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Überstunden voll kompensierbar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Flexible Arbeitszeiten im Rahmen eines Gleitzeitmodells mit Blockzeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Europäische Projekteinsätze möglich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Rabattangebote im Stücki Center Basel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Umfassende Spesenregelung zur Aufwandserstattung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Mitarbeiter werben Mitarbeiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;2 verschiedene Pensionskassenlösungen (jährlich wechselbar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;U-Abo für Pendler&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Flache Hierarchien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Homeoffice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Höchster Standard für Arbeitssicherheit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;25 Urlaubstage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Volle Lohnzahlung im Krankheitsfall bis zum 30. Tag&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Weltweite Reiseversicherung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;UVG-Zusatzversicherung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Zuschuss für Velopendler&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Teilzeitarbeit möglich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Möglichkeit zu unbezahltem Urlaub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Reisetätigkeit&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die Laufzeit unserer Projekte liegt meist zwischen 6 und 24 Monaten. Abhängig von Projekt und Projektphase ist der Einsatzort hauptsächlich der Projektstandort beim Kunden, wobei Mobiles Arbeiten von Zuhause in Absprache mit der Projektleitung teilweise möglich ist. Bei BakerHicks hat man so die Möglichkeit immer wieder bei unterschiedlichen Kunden mit unterschiedlichen Technologien zu arbeiten. Man lernt neue Städte kennen und ist dennoch am Wochenende immer zuhause.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversität &amp;amp; Inklusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;Bei BakerHicks ist es uns wichtig, dass wir ein Umfeld schaffen, in dem sich alle zugehörig fühlen. Als Unternehmen sind wir in der glücklichen Lage, mit einem vielfältigen Team von Menschen mit den unterschiedlichsten Hintergründen und Erfahrungen zusammenzuarbeiten. Alle von uns sollten respektvolles und positives Verhalten erwarten können, das uns anspornt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/small&gt;&lt;small&gt;Um sicherzustellen, dass wir immer ein offenes Ohr haben und ständig dazulernen, haben wir ein Team zusammengestellt, das uns dabei hilft, unsere Strategien für Diversität und Inklusion zu steuern.&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/bakerhicks/qualifizierungsingenieur-gmp-compliance-projektstandort-visp-335786","tags":["Life Sciences - Switzerland"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792011342},{"slug":"senior-frontend-engineer-luzern-121805","company_name":"Callista Group AG","title":"Senior Frontend Engineer","description":"<p>Für die Verstärkung eines agilen Produktteams innerhalb eines Agile Release Train bei einem unserer Kunden in Luzern suchen wir eine erfahrene Senior Frontend-Entwicklungspersönlichkeit. Im Fokus stehen eine starke operative Delivery, die saubere und selbstständige technische Umsetzung sowie eine verlässliche Zusammenarbeit im Team. Du konzipierst und realisierst komplexe Anforderungen eigenständig, bringst gute Engineering-Praktiken mit und treibst technische Themen konstruktiv voran.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Aufgaben</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>Eigenständige Konzeption und Umsetzung komplexer Frontend-Anforderungen mit Angular, TypeScript, HTML und SCSS</p></li><li><p>Entwicklung wiederverwendbarer Web Components mit hohem Anspruch an User Experience, Accessibility und Usability</p></li><li><p>Erarbeitung und Umsetzung architekturkonformer Lösungen inkl. Dokumentation</p></li><li><p>Sicherstellung der Qualität durch E2E-Tests und UI-Testing mit Storybook und Chromatic</p></li><li><p>Gezielter Einsatz von AI-basierten Coding-Assistants wie GitHub Copilot zur Steigerung von Qualität und Entwicklungsgeschwindigkeit</p></li><li><p>Proaktive Identifikation von Verbesserungspotenzialen in Code und Prozessen</p></li><li><p>Enge, teamübergreifende Zusammenarbeit mit Fachbereich und Entwicklungsteam sowie Weitergabe von Wissen im Team</p></li></ul> <br> <ul><li><p>Fundierte praktische Erfahrung als Senior Frontend-Entwickler mit Angular, TypeScript, HTML und SCSS</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Ausgeprägtes Know-how in Web Components, Accessibility und Usability sowie Begeisterung für gute User Experience</p></li><li><p>Erfahrung im DevOps- und Cloud-Umfeld</p></li><li><p>Praxis mit E2E-Tests und UI-Testing, idealerweise mit Storybook und Chromatic</p></li><li><p>Sicherer Umgang mit modernen AI-basierten Coding-Assistants (z.B. GitHub Copilot)</p></li><li><p>Fähigkeit, anspruchsvolle Architekturanforderungen souverän in hochwertigen Code zu übersetzen und komplexe technische Herausforderungen zu lösen</p></li><li><p>Erfahrung und Bereitschaft in der Backend-Entwicklung mit Java von Vorteil</p></li><li><p>Erfahrung in agilen Teams, umsetzungsorientierte Macher-Mentalität und hohes Mass an Selbstständigkeit und Verantwortungsbewusstsein</p></li><li><p>Gelassenheit unter Druck sowie Freude daran, Wissen zu teilen</p></li><li><p>Adressatengerechte Kommunikation in Deutsch auf Niveau C1</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Generelle Rahmenbedingungen</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>Start: Ab sofort</p></li><li><p>Dauer: bis 31.12.2026 (Option auf Verlängerung)</p></li><li><p>Pensum: 100 %</p></li><li><p>Arbeitsort: Luzern</p></li><li><p>Remote: Max. 3 Tage pro Woche (zwei Teamtage vor Ort)</p></li><li><p>Sprache: Deutsch</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/callista-group-ag/senior-frontend-engineer-luzern-121805","tags":["Software Engineering"],"job_types":["Experienced","freelance"],"location":"Luzern, Luzern, Switzerland","created_at":1792009949},{"slug":"quality-assurance-specialist-klazienaveen-129201","company_name":"Norit","title":"Quality Assurance Specialist","description":"<p><strong>Word jij onze nieuwe QA Specialist in Klazienaveen?</strong></p><p>Ben jij een kwaliteitsprofessional die energie krijgt van verbeteren, adviseren en het borgen van kwaliteit? </p><p>Wil je werken in een organisatie waar je echt impact kunt maken en waar jouw expertise bijdraagt aan veilige en hoogwaardige producten? Dan zijn wij op zoek naar jou!</p><p>Als QA Specialist ben jij een belangrijke schakel binnen ons Quality Team. Je draagt actief bij aan het onderhouden en verder ontwikkelen van onze kwaliteitssystemen en ondersteunt de organisatie bij het voldoen aan GMP-, FSSC 22000- en ISO-eisen. Met jouw kritische blik, analytisch vermogen en verbetergerichte mindset help je onze processen elke dag een stap beter te maken. </p><p>Daarbij werk je nauw samen met collega's, met name van QC om kwaliteit, compliance en continue verbetering binnen de organisatie te waarborgen.</p><p><strong>Wat ga je doen?</strong></p><ul><li>Adviseren van de organisatie op basis van data- en procesanalyses om kwaliteitsprestaties continu te verbeteren.</li><li>Onderhouden en optimaliseren van het kwaliteitsmanagementsysteem.</li><li>Coördineren en opstellen van de jaarlijkse management review.</li><li>Initiëren, begeleiden en opvolgen van interne en externe audits.</li><li>Beheren van afwijkingen, klachten, CAPA's en verbeteracties.</li><li>Beoordelen en beheren van wijzigingen en uitvoeren van risicoanalyses.</li><li>Uitvoeren van trendanalyses en vertalen van bevindingen naar verbetermaatregelen.</li><li>Signaleren van kwaliteitsrisico's en proactief initiëren van verbeteringen.</li><li>Nauw samenwerken met QC bij het beoordelen van analyseresultaten, afwijkingen, kwaliteitsrisico's en verbeterinitiatieven.</li><li>Fungeren als sparringpartner voor QC en Operations op het gebied van kwaliteitsvraagstukken, compliance en continue verbetering.</li><li>Ondersteunen bij leverancierskwalificaties en het monitoren van leveranciersprestaties.</li><li>Ondersteunen bij validatie- en verificatieactiviteiten van processen, systemen en methoden.</li><li>Beheren van kwaliteitsdocumentatie in Manual Master.</li><li>Ondersteunen van verbeterprojecten binnen de organisatie.</li><li>Verzorgen van kwaliteitstrainingen en bijdragen aan het kwaliteitsbewustzijn binnen de organisatie.</li><li>Vrijgeven van producten conform GMP-, FSSC 22000- en ISO 9001-eisen.</li></ul><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul><ul><li>Een relevante HBO-opleiding.</li><li>Minimaal 3 jaar relevante werkervaring binnen de (proces)industrie.</li><li>Ervaring met kwaliteitsmanagementsystemen, audits, afwijkingenbeheer en CAPA's.</li><li>Ervaring met Change Control, risicoanalyses en continue verbeterprogramma's.</li><li>Ervaring met trendanalyses en het werken met kwaliteits-KPI's.</li><li>Kennis en/of ervaring met GMP, ISO 9001, ISO 14001 en FSSC 22000.</li><li>Ervaring met een documentmanagementsysteem, bij voorkeur Manual Master.</li><li>Ervaring met Power BI voor data-analyse en rapportages is een pré.</li><li>Kennis van validatie- en kwalificatieprocessen is een pré.</li><li>Ervaring met grondoorzaakanalyses (bijvoorbeeld 5 Why's of Fishbone) is een pré.</li><li>Een zelfstandige werkhouding, eigenaarschap en een pragmatische instelling.</li><li>Goede communicatieve vaardigheden in zowel Nederlands als Engels.</li></ul></ul><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Een uitdagende functie met veel verantwoordelijkheden en ruimte voor eigen initiatief</li><li>Een informele organisatie met korte lijnen en betrokken collega's.</li><li>Een cultuur waarin samenwerken, leren en verbeteren centraal staan.</li><li>Volop mogelijkheden voor persoonlijke ontwikkeling via trainingen, opleidingen en on-the-job learning.</li><li>Een werkomgeving waarin jouw bijdrage daadwerkelijk verschil maakt.</li></ul><p><strong>Wat bieden wij?</strong></p><ul><li>Salaris tussen <strong>€ 4.700 en € 6.000 bruto per maand</strong> met 8% vakantiegeld en 13e maand, afhankelijk van de ervaring van de kandidaat;</li><li>▪ vakantiedagen - 25 dagen, </li><li>25 vakantiedagen per jaar.</li><li>Een jaarcontract met uitzicht op een vast dienstverband.</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/norit/quality-assurance-specialist-klazienaveen-129201","tags":["Manufacturing","Chemicals"],"job_types":["Full time","associate"],"location":"Klazienaveen, Netherlands","created_at":1792272016},{"slug":"engineering-lead-finance-internal-tools-amsterdam-171567","company_name":"Workwize","title":"Engineering Lead (Finance & Internal Tools)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workwize&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workwize helps companies equip their remote and global teams with IT equipment. Our SaaS platform takes care of buying, delivering, managing and returning laptops and other devices in more than 100 countries. Today more than 50,000 users and 120,000 devices are managed through Workwize.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the team that builds the systems behind our finance and internal operations. That means billing, invoicing and the internal tools our Operations and Finance teams use every day. The team is small but has a big impact. Mistakes here are expensive, so quality and good judgement matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You lead the engineers, work closely with the team&#39;s Product Manager and report to the Engineering Manager. You also work directly with senior leadership. You own the people, the way the team works and the delivery of the roadmap. You stay close to the code: about 30 to 40% of your time goes to code reviews, technical design and some hands-on work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow your engineers through 1:1s, clear feedback and growth plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear bar for performance, and act early when someone is not meeting it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery of the team&#39;s roadmap and keep progress, risks and blockers visible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the roadmap and quarterly goals with Product, Operations and Finance, including what we say no to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run planning, refinement and retros, and represent the team in talks with other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep standards high on code review, testing, monitoring, security and incident follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire new engineers for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set good habits for using AI tools in development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years as a software engineer, including at least 1 to 2 years managing engineers with direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling performance issues: setting expectations, giving hard feedback and supporting someone who is struggling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership style that can switch between directing and coaching, depending on the situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to explain and defend your point of view to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a modern web stack. We use Laravel (PHP), Node.js, React, Filament and MySQL. You don&#39;t need to know all of them, because strong engineers learn them fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering B2B web products end to end, working with non-technical colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily use of AI tools in your development work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and spoken English (Dutch is not needed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in FinTech, or with finance and billing systems (invoicing, order-to-cash, tax, or accounting and ERP integrations like Exact or QuickBooks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Laravel Filament or other admin panel tools, or moving internal tools off low-code platforms like Retool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building LLM features or AI agents for internal operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale-up experience, ideally in B2B SaaS, logistics or operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the Netherlands: hybrid, 2 to 3 days a week in our Amsterdam office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elsewhere in EMEA: remote, with working hours that overlap with CET and occasional visits to Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short video interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team fit interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study: two short role-play scenarios with the panel. You don&#39;t need to prepare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top tools and equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial culture with room to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Off-sites and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team lunches and surprise events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass corporate membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/workwize/engineering-lead-finance-internal-tools-amsterdam-171567","tags":["Tech"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1792270513},{"slug":"cleanroom-equipment-technician-zoetermeer-196997","company_name":"Black Semiconductor GmbH","title":"Cleanroom Equipment Technician","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Over ons</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">De halfgeleiderindustrie vraagt om steeds krachtigere chips: meer bandbreedte, minder energieverbruik. Onze technologie levert precies dat. Wij verbinden chips met computernetwerken die enorme hoeveelheden data verwerken, met minimale vertraging. Samen veranderen we de manier waarop de wereld met elkaar verbonden is.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In Zoetermeer werkt ons grafeenteam aan de toekomst van de halfgeleiderindustrie, van onderzoek en ontwikkeling tot industrialisatie. Op het snijvlak van materiaalkunde en halfgeleidertechnologie ontwikkelt het team de processen om grafeen te produceren, te karakteriseren en te integreren. Die processen vormen de basis van onze geïntegreerde grafeenfotonica. Het team pioniert met nieuwe procestechnologie en schaalt die op tot productierijpe oplossingen. Zo wordt baanbrekend onderzoek omgezet in de bouwstenen van de chips van morgen.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>De functie</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Black Semiconductor is op zoek naar een gemotiveerde <strong>Technicus (m/v/x)</strong> om ons team op locatie in Zoetermeer, Nederland, te versterken.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Je speelt een cruciale rol bij het waarborgen van de betrouwbare werking van alle technische systemen die onze cleanroomomgeving ondersteunen. Je bent verantwoordelijk voor onderhouds-, storingsanalyse- en reparatiewerkzaamheden aan voorzieningen zoals luchtbehandeling, gas-, water- en elektrische systemen. Deze functie is ideaal voor een praktisch ingestelde professional met technisch inzicht die graag zelfstandig werkt, technische uitdagingen oplost en nieuwe vaardigheden ontwikkelt in een sterk gecontroleerde en innovatieve omgeving.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Belangrijkste verantwoordelijkheden</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Zorgdragen voor een veilige en betrouwbare werking van cleanroomvoorzieningen, waaronder HVAC, toevoer- en afvoerlucht, gas-, water- en elektrische infrastructuur.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Uitvoeren van preventief onderhoud, storingsanalyse en reparaties aan productie en test apparatuur in de cleanroom en cleanroom systemen en inkomende nutsvoorzieningen.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Technische problemen diagnosticeren en oplossen om stilstand tot een minimum te beperken en de operationele continuïteit te waarborgen.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Onderhoudswerkzaamheden coördineren en uitvoeren, met inachtneming van normen en veiligheidsvoorschriften.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Verantwoordelijkheid nemen voor technische uitdagingen en proactief mogelijkheden identificeren voor systeemverbeteringen en een hogere betrouwbaarheid.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Jouw kwalificaties</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Afgeronde beroepsopleiding in een mechanische, technische of onderhoud gerelateerde richting (bijvoorbeeld automonteur, industrieel monteur, mechatronicatechnicus of vergelijkbaar).</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Praktische ervaring met mechanische systemen en basiskennis van elektrische, pneumatische, gas- of utiliteitssystemen.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sterke hands-on mentaliteit met het vertrouwen om onbekende technische uitdagingen aan te pakken en nieuwe technologieën te leren.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Vermogen om zelfstandig te werken, prioriteiten te stellen en volledige verantwoordelijkheid te nemen voor toegewezen taken.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Probleemoplossende instelling, sterke vaardigheden in storingsanalyse en bereidheid om te werken in een cleanroomomgeving met strikte kwaliteits- en veiligheidsnormen.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortabel met praktisch werk in cleanroom-, laboratorium- en facilitaire omgevingen, inclusief het gebruik van ladders om verhoogde gebieden te bereiken en het werken in beperkte ruimtes onder de cleanroom wanneer dat nodig is.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">In staat om fysiek veeleisende onderhouds- en installatiewerkzaamheden veilig uit te voeren, zoals het vervangen van HEPA-filters, het bedienen van afsluiters, het positioneren van gascilinders en het verplaatsen van zware vacuümpompen. Voor zware lasten worden geschikte hulpmiddelen en ondersteuning van collega’s ingezet.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sterke communicatieve vaardigheden in het Engels, bij voorkeur ook in het Nederlands om te kunnen communiceren met externe partijen, management en operators.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ervaring in de halfgeleiderindustrie is niet vereist. Je ontvangt de nodige training en ondersteuning om de apparatuur te leren kennen en je technische vaardigheden verder te ontwikkelen.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hoe succes eruitziet</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Volledige verantwoordelijkheid nemen voor de cleanroominfrastructuur</strong>, en zorgen voor een betrouwbare werking van luchtbehandeling, gas-, water-, afzuig- en elektrische systemen met minimale stilstand.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Uitgroeien tot een vertrouwde technische expert binnen het team</strong>, door proactief problemen te signaleren, praktische oplossingen te implementeren en bij te dragen aan een veilige en efficiënte werkomgeving.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sterke zelfstandigheid en verantwoordelijkheidsgevoel tonen</strong>, door onderhouds- en reparatiewerkzaamheden zelfstandig te beheren en effectief prioriteiten te stellen in een dynamische omgeving.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technische kennis en vaardigheden continu uitbreiden</strong>, snel nieuwe systemen en technologieën eigen maken en tegelijkertijd de hoge standaarden handhaven die vereist zijn binnen een cleanroomomgeving.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Onze werkcultuur</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Mensen boven processen.</strong> Bij Black Semiconductor is flexibiliteit essentieel — wij zorgen ervoor dat werk zich aanpast aan het leven, en niet andersom. We stimuleren een gezonde balans tussen werk en privé, waarin carrières betekenisvol en verrijkend zijn. Onze processen zijn mensgericht, zodat jij je kunt richten op wat echt belangrijk is.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Laten we samen groeien.</strong> Jouw potentieel staat bij ons centraal. We bieden de autonomie om blijvende impact te maken en ondersteunen jouw groei met een cultuur van continu leren. We investeren in jouw professionele én persoonlijke ontwikkeling.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Jouw gezondheid en toekomst zijn belangrijk.</strong> Jouw welzijn heeft de hoogste prioriteit. Daarom bieden wij een uitgebreid arbeidsvoorwaardenpakket met uitstekende verzekeringen, een pensioenregeling en virtuele aandelenopties voor jouw mentale, fysieke en financiële gezondheid. Jouw gemoedsrust staat bij ons centraal — nu én in de toekomst.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Wij leven openheid.</strong> Samenwerking en inclusiviteit vormen de hoekstenen van onze cultuur. Wij geloven in openheid en bouwen aan vertrouwen en respect. Individualiteit is onze gezamenlijke kracht, die innovatie stimuleert en ons vooruit helpt.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Wij verbinden chips – en mensen.</strong> Wij moedigen gekwalificeerde kandidaten van iedere achtergrond aan om te solliciteren. We creëren een inclusieve en ondersteunende werkomgeving waarin samenwerking, innovatie en groei centraal staan. Sluit je aan bij ons team en maak deel uit van een organisatie die een verschil maakt in de industrie.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Kun jij jezelf zien in deze functie en binnen ons bedrijf? Laten we kennismaken.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>If your application results in an employment relationship, your Applicant Data will be transferred to our personnel records and processed in accordance with applicable legal requirements; otherwise, your Applicant Data will be retained for up to six (6) months after completion of the recruitment process. </em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.blacksemi.com/privacy-policy"><em>Read more about our privacy policy here. </em></a></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/black-semiconductor-gmbh/cleanroom-equipment-technician-zoetermeer-196997","tags":["Fab Management"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Zoetermeer, Netherlands","created_at":1792269615},{"slug":"senior-software-engineer-agentic-search-web-access-engineer-amsterdam-189394","company_name":"Tavily","title":"Senior Software Engineer (Agentic Search) - Web Access Engineer","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;About &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Tavily&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;building the infrastructure layer for agentic web interaction at scale. Our API is designed from the ground up to power Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and real-time reasoning in AI systems. By connecting LLMs to high-quality, trustworthy web content, we help developers build agents that are not only intelligent — but also informed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We work with some of the most innovative teams in AI — from small startups shaping the ecosystem to the largest enterprises deploying AI at scale. Whether&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;powering sales assistants, research copilots, or internal knowledge tools,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;the missing link between LLMs and the real world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer to build the web access infrastructure behind a novel search engine designed for agentic AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;In this role, you will investigate how modern websites communicate with browsers and translate that understanding into production systems operating at internet scale. You will build browser infrastructure and tooling that enables reliable, efficient access to web content across a rapidly changing web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Research and analyse how modern websites communicate with browsers across the complete request lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Investigate browser fingerprinting, client verification mechanisms, and modern web technologies to enable reliable web access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build tooling for browser instrumentation, debugging, observability, and large-scale experimentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Translate technical research into production systems operating at internet scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You have 5+ years of experience as a software engineer working on production backend or infrastructure systems, and are an expert in several of the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Browser Technologies&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Chromium architecture and browser internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Browser lifecycle and navigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium, or similar browser automation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Browser instrumentation and debugging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Web Platform&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2, HTTP/3 — TLS, DNS, and browser networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Cookies, browser storage, caching, redirects, and session management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;JavaScript execution and modern client-side rendering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Resource loading, page lifecycle, and browser networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Browser fingerprinting concepts and browser characteristics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working on browser engines or browser infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience reverse engineering browser or web application behaviour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building internet-scale distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Go, C++, Rust, or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Kubernetes and cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
