&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Vinted continues to scale and expand its product offerings, acquiring the right talent remains core to our growth, and our Talent Acquisition team is a key driver behind it. Proactive sourcing, designing fair assessment processes, delivering a seamless candidate experience, consulting business stakeholders on hiring decisions, and constant refinement to ensure quality and efficiency is our bread and butter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Talent Acquisition Manager, you will join our TA Leadership Team to shape and execute a forward-looking talent acquisition strategy aligned with Vinted’s business ambitions. In this role, you will build and empower a high-performing TA team, cultivating a healthy, collaborative environment grounded in our Leadership Way and core values. Serving as a strategic partner to senior business leaders and the broader People function, you will translate market intelligence and TA analytics into actionable hiring plans, lead high-impact recruitment initiatives, and drive continuous operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are an experienced TA leader passionate about developing people, optimising hiring processes, and scaling impactful talent acquisition initiatives, we would love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and develop a team of TA Specialists, ensuring excellent performance, fostering growth, continuous learning, and a collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As part of the Talent Acquisition leadership team, co-create and drive the implementation of TA strategy and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior business leaders and hiring managers to co-create and implement effective functional TA strategy in line with business context.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee end-to-end recruitment execution, ensuring quality assessments, efficient processes, and high standards across candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to senior leadership on market trends, salary benchmarking, candidate pipelines, and resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, analyze, and report on key TA metrics to continuously optimise recruitment performance, improve process efficiency and quality of hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and contribute to cross-functional TA projects, such as interviewer training, employer branding, hiring framework improvements, and recruiter enablement tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record as a Talent Acquisition Manager or TA Team Lead, managing performance, development, and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of modern sourcing strategies, candidate evaluation techniques, and competitive talent markets across Tech functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using recruitment analytics to evaluate efficiency, identify bottlenecks, and inform decisions for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with a proven ability to navigate ambiguity, identify root causes, and implement pragmatic, effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills with the ability to influence, guide, and collaborate with senior business stakeholders, hiring managers, and People team colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal English communication skills (English is Vinted’s official working language).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€78.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€105.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/vinteden/talent-acquisition-manager-talent-acquisition-amsterdam-176448","tags":["People"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1792259719},{"slug":"remote-founding-platform-engineer-netherlands-152205","company_name":"Mlabs","title":"Founding Platform Engineer","description":"<p>We are hiring on behalf of our client, a fast-growing innovator in the crypto and decentralized finance space who is seeking a <strong>Founding Platform Engineer</strong> (Staff+ level) to join the team. This organization is behind a leading decentralized exchange (DEX) on HyperEVM, having achieved significant revenue milestones with an ultra-lean team. The client is now expanding its technical architecture to build an advanced, mobile-first crypto trading platform (spot + perps) alongside a novel, original social product featuring cutting-edge mechanisms.</p><p>As the first and only engineer in this specialized domain, the incoming candidate will take an original product vision and turn it into a robust, high-performance system—holding the entire architecture and the smallest details simultaneously. The operational environment is primarily asynchronous, highly independent, and built for top-tier developers who can scale infrastructure from zero to massive daily trading volumes while maintaining absolute reliability.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Platform Ownership:</strong> Own the core platform, including the data layer, rewards engine, notifications, the API surface, and overall system reliability.</li><li><strong>Trading Engine Integration:</strong> Integrate perpetual trading engines through Hyperliquid, alongside spot trading via Jupiter and Relay.</li><li><strong>Data Harmonization:</strong> Aggregate and unify conflicting data providers (such as Zerion, CoinGecko, Mobula, Alchemy, and Hyperliquid) into a single, cohesive source of truth.</li><li><strong>High-Performance Data Delivery:</strong> Serve heavy data rapidly by implementing resilient caching mechanisms that survive traffic stampedes and fan-out structures that hold under pressure.</li><li><strong>Cross-Chain Abstraction:</strong> Design architecture that makes a single USDC balance across multiple chains entirely invisible and seamless to the end user.</li><li><strong>Peak Performance &amp; Reliability:</strong> Maintain absolute uptime during peak market volatility; ensure the application never lags or crashes when it matters most, guaranteeing users can always close positions.</li></ul><p>﻿</p><p>Requirements</p><ul><li>Proven track record of engineering resilience, including keeping a high-stakes system alive through massive traffic spikes and determining graceful degradation strategies in advance.</li><li>Extensive experience building financial rewards and accounting systems that withstand retries, prioritizing idempotency, replay safety, and precise lot tracking.</li><li>Deep understanding of end-to-end latency budgets (from a user's tap to screen rendering).</li><li>Advanced database optimization skills, capable of resolving bottlenecks directly within PostgreSQL rather than relying on secondary databases.</li><li>Strong proficiency in Rust development.</li><li>Comfortable working in a fast-paced, remote environment across North American or European timezones.</li></ul><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><p><strong>Competitive Compensation:</strong> Top-market base salary paired with significant equity upside.</p><p><strong>Flexible &amp; Remote-First Work:</strong> 100% remote working model with flexible schedules and high operational autonomy.</p><p></p><p><br> </p><p></p><p><strong>Due to the high volume of applications we anticipate, we regret that we are unable to provide individual feedback to all candidates. If you do not hear back from us within 4 weeks of your application, please assume that you have not been successful on this occasion. We genuinely appreciate your interest and wish you the best in your job search.</strong></p><p><strong>Commitment to Equality and Accessibility:</strong></p><p>At MLabs, we are committed to offer equal opportunities to all candidates. We ensure no discrimination, accessible job adverts, and providing information in accessible formats. Our goal is to foster a diverse, inclusive workplace with equal opportunities for all. If you need any reasonable adjustments during any part of the hiring process or you would like to see the job-advert in an accessible format please let us know at the earliest opportunity by emailing ----- Ltd collects and processes the personal information you provide such as your contact details, work history, resume, and other relevant data for recruitment purposes only. This information is managed securely in accordance with MLabs Ltd’s Privacy Policy and Information Security Policy, and in compliance with applicable data protection laws. Your data may be shared only with clients and trusted partners where necessary for recruitment purposes. You may request the deletion of your data or withdraw your consent at any time by contacting -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/mlabs/remote-founding-platform-engineer-netherlands-152205","tags":["ADE","Remote"],"job_types":[],"location":"Netherlands","created_at":1792239605},{"slug":"staff-software-engineer-applied-ai-amsterdam-138358","company_name":"Flexport","title":"Staff Software Engineer: Applied AI","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Staff Software Engineer: Applied AI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day, thousands of shipments cross borders, change hands, and hit unexpected problems. For decades, fixing those problems meant phone calls, emails, and humans heroically firefighting. We think that&#39;s about to change completely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve been building AI agents that spot trouble before it happens, reroute shipments, and keep goods moving—with our team of experts in the loop where it counts. The early results have been jaw-dropping. We&#39;re now going all in on a future where supply chains run themselves, and we&#39;re looking for the people who want to build that future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role where you join a team and pick up tickets. You&#39;ll find the highest-leverage problems, design the solutions, and ship them to operators moving freight across 112 countries. If that sounds like your idea of a good time, read on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build the cutting-edge agents and AI-powered applications that make Flexport&#39;s operations smarter, faster, and increasingly autonomous. That means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and shipping &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end AI agents&lt;/strong&gt; that handle real logistics work—customs compliance, document processing, exception management, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crossing organizational boundaries&lt;/strong&gt; to understand problems deeply, align stakeholders, and get things done without waiting for permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moving fast from idea to production, treating every deployment as a learning opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with operators, domain experts, and leadership to turn ambiguous problems into shipped solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Should Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;; you&#39;ve built with LLMs extensively — whether in production, side projects, or just because you couldn&#39;t stop yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product instincts&lt;/strong&gt;: you can identify what&#39;s worth building, not just execute on a spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: agent patterns, RAG, prompt engineering, tool use, evaluation. You know what works in production and what looks good in demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack capability&lt;/strong&gt; in TypeScript and Next.js—you can own a feature end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial drive&lt;/strong&gt;: you thrive in ambiguity, move fast, and don&#39;t wait to be told what to do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication&lt;/strong&gt;: you can work across teams and disciplines to get alignment and unblock yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An audacious appetite for impact&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;re not here to maintain—you&#39;re here to change how global trade works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow orchestration (Temporal, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tools or operator-facing applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We come to the office 3 times a week to hang out, whiteboard, and ship together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have the latest hardware and software—including frontier AI models on day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re agile, but not dogmatic. Teams decide how they work best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack&lt;/strong&gt;: Next.js, TypeScript, Postgres, Snowflake. For AI: Anthropic, OpenAI, Google AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Role Is Special&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your work is visible&lt;/strong&gt;: This is a small, senior team reporting directly to the VP of Engineering. What you build gets noticed, and your ideas shape the direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real stakes&lt;/strong&gt;: thousands of containers, 112 countries, $19 billion of goods. Your agents will have immediate, measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: from problem definition to production deployment, it&#39;s yours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re early&lt;/strong&gt;: the playbook for applied AI in enterprise logistics doesn&#39;t exist yet—you&#39;ll help write it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunches incl. vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and soft drinks available in our office on daily basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute expenses: Flexport will cover&amp;nbsp; home-office commuting costs for employees living outside of Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers a collective health insurance plan including a basic package and any available additional packages. Your monthly premium is fully paid by Flexport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined pension contribution scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot;&gt;
